1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,320
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,080
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,940
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,320
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:28,040
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,520
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:35,080
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:39,800
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:44,120
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,960
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:58,040
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:02,120
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:09,040
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,680
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:18,779
=Episode 8=

17
00:01:18,921 --> 00:01:23,293
(In Memory of Mr. Qin Hai)

18
00:01:23,519 --> 00:01:24,480
What's there to discuss?

19
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:27,040
We take our men to Nanhu Gang

20
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,760
and avenge Boss Hai.

21
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:30,560
We still don't know

22
00:01:31,799 --> 00:01:34,439
if Gui Sheng really killed Boss Hai.

23
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,560
(Honor and Justice)
That's what he said.

24
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:39,920
(Respect the Law. Keep Your Honor.)
Boss Hai would give up three routes.

25
00:01:40,439 --> 00:01:41,120
You believe that?

26
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:44,120
None of us saw it.

27
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,560
Hui.

28
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,359
You've got the most men.

29
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,480
Are you afraid?

30
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:54,840
Someone else killed Boss Hai.

31
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,439
What are you getting at?

32
00:01:58,519 --> 00:01:59,159
Boss Ji.

33
00:02:01,079 --> 00:02:02,480
That's not the point.

34
00:02:03,239 --> 00:02:04,519
They kidnapped Boss Hai.

35
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,280
That's a serious offense.

36
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:10,400
(Loyalty Hall)
We've fought Nanhu Gang for years.

37
00:02:11,159 --> 00:02:12,280
But we've always followed the rules

38
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:13,599
and known where to draw the line.

39
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,120
This time is different.

40
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,360
This time,

41
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:18,280
they showed Dongcheng no respect.

42
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:21,080
I won't stand for that.

43
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:22,719
What about you?

44
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:28,639
Boss Yong.

45
00:02:29,759 --> 00:02:30,719
You make the call.

46
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:31,960
I'll follow your lead.

47
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:39,479
Hui.

48
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,199
Tai.

49
00:02:41,919 --> 00:02:44,360
You two have the biggest crews.

50
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:45,800
Lead the charge.

51
00:02:47,199 --> 00:02:47,960
But

52
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:51,080
until we know how Boss Hai died,

53
00:02:51,719 --> 00:02:53,159
no one makes a move.

54
00:03:00,879 --> 00:03:01,840
Let's eat first.

55
00:03:04,039 --> 00:03:04,800
What's wrong?

56
00:03:06,439 --> 00:03:07,199
No, thanks.

57
00:03:08,639 --> 00:03:09,560
Is the time set?

58
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,439
Tomorrow at 8:00 p.m.

59
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:13,759
Eight.

60
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,560
Gui Sheng

61
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:17,719
has plenty of men.

62
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:20,000
Tomorrow could get rough.

63
00:03:20,759 --> 00:03:21,800
Don't worry. I'll be there.

64
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:24,680
I doubt you will see any action.

65
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:27,960
You won't get to fight.

66
00:03:28,599 --> 00:03:30,000
Want to bet?

67
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:31,280
Bet what?

68
00:03:31,879 --> 00:03:32,439
A bottle.

69
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:36,680
Deal.

70
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,520
Yellow means one of us.

71
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:45,319
Put on your armbands.

72
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:50,479
Grab your weapons.

73
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,079
Gui Sheng.

74
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,480
About Boss Hai,

75
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,079
you owe me answers today.

76
00:04:19,319 --> 00:04:20,319
Answers for what?

77
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,199
Qin Hai is dead.

78
00:04:22,519 --> 00:04:24,120
What's that got to do with Nanhu Gang?

79
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:27,120
You kidnapped one of my men.

80
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:28,920
You think Nanhu Gang's a pushover?

81
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,600
Enough nonsense.

82
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:34,240
About Boss Hai's death,

83
00:04:34,879 --> 00:04:36,120
you know exactly what happened.

84
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:40,680
Gui Sheng.

85
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,079
You killed him to shut him up,

86
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,920
and claim you had nothing to do with it?

87
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,000
That's proof enough.

88
00:04:59,474 --> 00:05:01,944
♪I won this life on a roll of the dice♪

89
00:05:01,944 --> 00:05:05,152
♪I staked my soul to set myself free♪

90
00:05:05,649 --> 00:05:09,481
♪I was born too tough to break♪

91
00:05:12,519 --> 00:05:16,323
♪Tough enough to walk this road to ruin♪

92
00:05:18,779 --> 00:05:23,094
♪This is my fate. I won't fight it♪

93
00:05:25,564 --> 00:05:29,084
♪I'd rather call my own shots♪

94
00:05:32,363 --> 00:05:34,804
♪Incense fades, but ashes still burn♪

95
00:05:34,804 --> 00:05:37,586
♪Every prayer at the altar rings hollow♪

96
00:05:38,892 --> 00:05:41,433
♪On this long road, never bow your head♪

97
00:05:41,433 --> 00:05:44,712
♪On this road, there's no turning back♪

98
00:05:45,152 --> 00:05:48,258
♪The faces onstage keep changing♪

99
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,160
Don't move!

100
00:05:57,879 --> 00:05:59,079
Don't move! Don't run!

101
00:05:59,439 --> 00:05:59,920
Don't move!

102
00:06:00,079 --> 00:06:00,639
Don't run!

103
00:06:05,199 --> 00:06:05,839
Boss Tai, go!

104
00:06:11,199 --> 00:06:12,720
Boss Hui, get out of here!

105
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:13,279
Go!

106
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:19,639
After them!

107
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:55,560
Boss Tai.

108
00:06:55,839 --> 00:06:57,279
I had nothing to do with his death.

109
00:06:57,279 --> 00:06:58,319
I have proof.

110
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:01,920
I know.

111
00:07:06,199 --> 00:07:07,600
Boss Tai! Boss Tai!

112
00:07:15,839 --> 00:07:16,319
Boss!

113
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:18,800
Police! Don't move!

114
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:21,199
Police! Stay where you are!

115
00:07:21,199 --> 00:07:23,160
Get down! Hands up!

116
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:23,920
I killed him!

117
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:24,720
I killed him!

118
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,680
Why arrest a fall guy?

119
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,160
The bosses

120
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:38,519
just post bail and walk.

121
00:07:39,279 --> 00:07:40,279
Why not just

122
00:07:40,399 --> 00:07:41,720
make your boss chief of police?

123
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,800
Why worry about it?

124
00:07:44,079 --> 00:07:47,000
Be glad you make it home safe.

125
00:07:51,759 --> 00:07:52,439
Officer Luo.

126
00:07:53,399 --> 00:07:54,279
Can I go now?

127
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:58,759
Technically,

128
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:01,000
(Shicheng Royal Police Headquarters)
I can still hold you for four hours.

129
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:07,680
There was an old man in my village.

130
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:09,600
He owned a small factory.

131
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,720
He had two sons.

132
00:08:12,639 --> 00:08:14,120
The older one was very capable.

133
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:16,600
The younger one did nothing.

134
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:20,040
Then the old man died.

135
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:23,240
(Loyalty Guards Our Glory)
Everyone expected the eldest to inherit.

136
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:26,759
But the younger son took over instead.

137
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,879
The older son said nothing.

138
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,039
But

139
00:08:34,399 --> 00:08:35,600
on his father's death anniversary,

140
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:37,440
he never went to pay his respects.

141
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:39,960
Less than two years later,

142
00:08:40,679 --> 00:08:41,919
the younger son died.

143
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:44,720
The factory went to the older son.

144
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:46,720
But

145
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,759
no one ever asked

146
00:08:48,759 --> 00:08:50,639
how the younger son died.

147
00:08:58,279 --> 00:08:58,919
Officer Luo.

148
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:02,679
I don't understand what you mean.

149
00:09:03,519 --> 00:09:04,759
It's just a story.

150
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,200
So you think

151
00:09:07,639 --> 00:09:09,399
Gui Sheng killed Boss Hai?

152
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,679
You think so too?

153
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:13,799
All I know is

154
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,840
the final report says

155
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,399
Boss Hai's fingers

156
00:09:17,679 --> 00:09:20,080
had been bitten by an animal.

157
00:09:25,879 --> 00:09:26,679
Su.

158
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:33,519
Before the talks get underway,

159
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,320
right at the start,

160
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:36,879
make your move.

161
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,480
Got it, Boss Tai.

162
00:09:45,559 --> 00:09:46,000
All right.

163
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,279
You can go.

164
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:48,799
Thanks.

165
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:49,840
This way.

166
00:10:05,879 --> 00:10:07,159
Mei, Fu.

167
00:10:07,399 --> 00:10:08,559
How about some fruit?

168
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:09,799
Here, Boss Hui.

169
00:10:10,159 --> 00:10:10,679
Thanks.

170
00:10:15,519 --> 00:10:17,799
How'd things go with Nanhu Gang?

171
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:21,720
Yong stepped in.

172
00:10:21,799 --> 00:10:24,240
Most Nanhu headquarters were taken over.

173
00:10:25,159 --> 00:10:26,720
The rest won't be much trouble.

174
00:10:27,039 --> 00:10:28,039
The man who killed Gui Sheng

175
00:10:29,039 --> 00:10:30,000
worked for Dongshan Tai.

176
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,240
They won't talk.

177
00:10:33,639 --> 00:10:34,879
The evidence against Nanhu Gang

178
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:36,279
was found by you, Boss Hui.

179
00:10:36,639 --> 00:10:37,879
You deserve a lot of credit.

180
00:10:40,919 --> 00:10:41,679
Here, Fu.

181
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,360
This apple is really sweet.

182
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:45,799
Thanks.

183
00:10:45,799 --> 00:10:46,440
Sweet.

184
00:10:47,639 --> 00:10:48,000
Here.

185
00:10:52,039 --> 00:10:53,360
Eat up, Wangcai.

186
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:19,360
At dinner with Boss Hui last night,

187
00:11:20,919 --> 00:11:21,960
something felt off.

188
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:22,840
What's really going on?

189
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,080
You noticed?

190
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,440
I don't think it's that simple.

191
00:11:29,559 --> 00:11:31,240
If Hutou Jun hadn't been silenced,

192
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,759
we wouldn't have hit Nanhu so soon.

193
00:11:34,559 --> 00:11:35,919
Why did we go after Nanhu?

194
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:37,840
You think...

195
00:11:39,279 --> 00:11:40,679
Gui Sheng didn't kill Boss Hai?

196
00:11:40,759 --> 00:11:42,200
If Hutou Jun was telling the truth

197
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,840
and Boss Hai signed that document,

198
00:11:44,519 --> 00:11:46,440
Nanhu's smuggling routes would be safe.

199
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,679
They'd have less reason to kill him.

200
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:51,320
Maybe Dongshan Tai used this

201
00:11:51,759 --> 00:11:52,639
as an excuse to kill Gui Sheng

202
00:11:53,279 --> 00:11:54,360
and win Yong's vote.

203
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:55,639
Boss Che.

204
00:11:57,639 --> 00:11:59,000
We need to investigate this.

205
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:00,600
I can't let Dongshan Tai get his way.

206
00:12:03,039 --> 00:12:03,639
Don't worry.

207
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,960
I'll see what I can get from Duan.

208
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:09,639
I'll look into it.

209
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,080
Here we go.

210
00:12:15,559 --> 00:12:17,320
Rock, paper...

211
00:12:18,679 --> 00:12:19,480
scissors!

212
00:12:25,960 --> 00:12:27,399
What are you laughing at, Fu?

213
00:12:34,879 --> 00:12:35,639
Bye, Fu.

214
00:12:35,919 --> 00:12:37,200
Bye, Che.

215
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:49,240
I went back to headquarters

216
00:12:49,639 --> 00:12:50,919
and found the document Boss Hai signed.

217
00:12:55,826 --> 00:12:59,019
(Shipping Route Transfer Agreement)

218
00:13:00,919 --> 00:13:01,559
Thanks.

219
00:13:02,879 --> 00:13:03,600
I owed you.

220
00:13:04,039 --> 00:13:04,600
Now we're even.

221
00:13:06,159 --> 00:13:06,960
Everything's set.

222
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,320
Two in the morning.

223
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,279
Shitou will get you out.

224
00:13:10,159 --> 00:13:11,159
Those two will take you there.

225
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:31,840
Can we go?

226
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:33,159
Sure.

227
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:37,679
Annie.

228
00:13:38,159 --> 00:13:40,600
Boss Lin says he has a big gift for you.

229
00:13:55,727 --> 00:13:58,907
(Dongcheng Gang Headquarters
Everlasting Loyalty)

230
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:17,600
(Respect the Law)

231
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,200
You're alive?

232
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:18,840
Stop!

233
00:14:19,799 --> 00:14:21,000
(Loyalty Hall)
As long as I'm here,

234
00:14:21,679 --> 00:14:23,240
no one touches him.

235
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,399
Tell the truth.

236
00:14:28,159 --> 00:14:28,919
It...

237
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:29,919
It was Boss Hui.

238
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:32,399
The day Boss Hai was attacked,

239
00:14:33,519 --> 00:14:35,000
Boss Hui sent me to pick him up.

240
00:14:35,639 --> 00:14:36,440
When I got there,

241
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:38,159
Hutou Jun was there too.

242
00:14:39,159 --> 00:14:40,279
Hutou Jun said

243
00:14:41,639 --> 00:14:43,120
he'd already made a deal with Boss Hui.

244
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:45,799
What did you say? Say it again.

245
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,200
Hui.

246
00:14:48,279 --> 00:14:49,320
Did you do it or not?

247
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:51,799
Even you don't believe me?

248
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:53,279
Yong.

249
00:14:54,279 --> 00:14:55,639
Zhong never picked up Boss Hai.

250
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:57,360
Hutou Jun spotted Zhong there,

251
00:14:57,919 --> 00:14:58,639
then blackmailed him.

252
00:14:59,039 --> 00:15:00,559
Hutou Jun is dead.

253
00:15:01,279 --> 00:15:02,840
Now you can say whatever you want.

254
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,240
Hey.

255
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:05,759
Boss Hai's death...

256
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:07,200
Could it have been

257
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,519
a setup between you and Nanhu Gang?

258
00:15:11,879 --> 00:15:12,440
Zhong.

259
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:14,200
Let me ask you.

260
00:15:16,279 --> 00:15:18,000
When you met Hutou Jun that day,

261
00:15:18,399 --> 00:15:19,440
what car was he driving?

262
00:15:20,759 --> 00:15:21,720
A Mercedes S-Class.

263
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,639
What color?

264
00:15:24,639 --> 00:15:25,240
White.

265
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:27,879
Then what?

266
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:32,440
I helped them get Boss Hai in the car.

267
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:35,159
Then we took him to Hutou Jun's factory.

268
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,600
How did you get back?

269
00:15:38,559 --> 00:15:39,759
And when did you get your car back?

270
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,039
One of the guys...

271
00:15:41,039 --> 00:15:42,840
One of his guys drove me back.

272
00:15:43,639 --> 00:15:45,360
Then I went to...

273
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,519
You're lying.

274
00:15:48,879 --> 00:15:51,039
These photos are all timestamped.

275
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,039
Your car

276
00:15:53,759 --> 00:15:55,440
stayed there for only ten minutes.

277
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:58,759
Boss Hui.

278
00:16:01,759 --> 00:16:04,200
A photo studio owner took these.

279
00:16:04,799 --> 00:16:06,600
They show the exact time and place.

280
00:16:08,799 --> 00:16:09,759
(Dec. 13, 1999, 14:22)
Zhong saw

281
00:16:10,039 --> 00:16:11,360
(Dec. 13, 1999, 14:30)
Boss Hai being abducted.

282
00:16:12,759 --> 00:16:14,000
He chose not to step in.

283
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:16,039
He ran instead.

284
00:16:17,879 --> 00:16:19,879
I had no choice but to say that!

285
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:22,080
Think carefully before you answer.

286
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:23,159
Who put you up to this?

287
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:26,759
Go check on him.

288
00:16:39,639 --> 00:16:40,240
Well?

289
00:16:41,759 --> 00:16:42,480
He's not breathing.

290
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:52,320
It was a misunderstanding.

291
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:54,320
Hui.

292
00:16:54,759 --> 00:16:56,320
You're not one to hold a grudge.

293
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:01,559
Boss Yong.

294
00:17:01,799 --> 00:17:04,839
Since Tai avenged Boss Hai,

295
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:07,359
shouldn't we start preparing

296
00:17:08,079 --> 00:17:09,880
for the shot-caller election?

297
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:11,440
That's not true.

298
00:17:12,279 --> 00:17:13,960
The evidence against Nanhu Gang

299
00:17:14,759 --> 00:17:15,559
was found by you, Boss Hui.

300
00:17:16,119 --> 00:17:17,319
You deserve a lot of credit.

301
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:19,279
Since

302
00:17:20,079 --> 00:17:21,319
Hai's been avenged...

303
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:24,160
Gui Sheng wasn't the one
who killed Boss Hai!
